+          "source_id": "mlp:burns",
+          "source_excerpt": "You may have an airway burn if you have: Burns on the head, face, neck, eyebrows, or nose hairs Burned lips and mouth Coughing Difficulty breathing Dark, black-stained mucus Voice changes Wheezing First Aid Before giving first aid, it is important to determine what type of burn the person has. If you are not sure, treat it as a major burn. Serious burns need medical care right away.",
