+          "id": "airway-burn-no-pillow",
+          "source_id": "mlp:burns",
+          "source_excerpt": "Do not remove clothing that is stuck to the skin. Do not give the person anything by mouth if there is a severe burn. Do not place a severe burn in cold water. This can cause shock. Do not place a pillow under the person's head if there is an airway burn. This can close the airway.",
