+          "source_id": "mlp:electrical-injury",
+          "source_excerpt": "Stay with the person until medical help arrives. An electrical injury is frequently associated with explosions or falls that can cause additional severe injuries. You may not be able to notice all of them. Do not move the person's head or neck if the spine may be injured.",
