+          "source_id": "mlp:heat",
+          "source_excerpt": "When to Contact a Medical Professional Call 911 or the local emergency number if: The person loses consciousness at any time. There is any other change in the person's alertness (for example, confusion or seizures). The person has a fever over 102°F (38.9°C).",
