+          "source_id": "mlp:dislocation",
+          "source_excerpt": "The main symptom is pain so that the child doesn't want to use the arm. This dislocation can be easily treated in your provider's office. First Aid First aid steps to take: Call 911 or the local emergency number before you begin treating someone who may have a dislocation, especially if the accident that caused the injury may be life threatening.",
