+      "actionable_lines": [
+        {
+          "field_path": "do[0]",
+          "text": "هَدّي المصاب، وراعي خصوصيته، وغطّي المكان المصاب وإنت بتعمل الإسعافات الأولية.",
+          "source_id": "mlp:genital-injury",
+          "source_context_section": "First Aid",
+          "source_excerpt": "In men and young boys, common causes of genital injury include: Having the toilet seat fall down onto the area Getting the area caught in a pant zipper Straddle injury: falling and landing with the legs on each side of a bar, such as a monkey bar or the middle of a bicycle Symptoms Symptoms may include: Abdominal pain Bleeding Bruising Change in shape of the affected area Faintness Foul-smelling vaginal or urethral discharge Object embedded in a body opening Groin pain or genital pain (can be extreme) Swelling Urine drainage Vomiting Urination that is painful or the inability to urinate Open wound First Aid Keep the person calm. Be sensitive to privacy. Cover the injured area while giving first aid. Control bleeding by using direct pressure.",
+          "qualifier_or_exception": "All conditions and exceptions in this excerpt were checked against the complete card.",
+          "card_carries": true,
+          "verdict": "PASS"
+        },
+        {
+          "field_path": "do[1]",
+          "text": "سيطر على النزيف بضغط مباشر، وحط قطعة قماش نضيفة أو غيار معقّم على أي جرح مفتوح. لو فيه نزيف شديد من المهبل، حط شاش معقّم أو قماش نضيف على المكان، إلا لو شاكك إن فيه جسم غريب.",
+          "source_id": "mlp:genital-injury",
+          "source_context_section": "First Aid",
+          "source_excerpt": "In men and young boys, common causes of genital injury include: Having the toilet seat fall down onto the area Getting the area caught in a pant zipper Straddle injury: falling and landing with the legs on each side of a bar, such as a monkey bar or the middle of a bicycle Symptoms Symptoms may include: Abdominal pain Bleeding Bruising Change in shape of the affected area Faintness Foul-smelling vaginal or urethral discharge Object embedded in a body opening Groin pain or genital pain (can be extreme) Swelling Urine drainage Vomiting Urination that is painful or the inability to urinate Open wound First Aid Keep the person calm. Be sensitive to privacy. Cover the injured area while giving first aid. Control bleeding by using direct pressure. Place a clean cloth or sterile dressing on any open wounds. If the vagina is bleeding severely, put sterile gauze or clean cloths on the area, unless a foreign body is suspected. Apply cold compresses to help reduce swelling.",
+          "qualifier_or_exception": "All conditions and exceptions in this excerpt were checked against the complete card.",
+          "card_carries": true,
+          "verdict": "PASS"
+        },
+        {
+          "field_path": "do[2]",
+          "text": "حط كمّادات باردة عشان تساعد تقلّل التورّم.",
+          "source_id": "mlp:genital-injury",
+          "source_context_section": "First Aid",
+          "source_excerpt": "Place a clean cloth or sterile dressing on any open wounds. If the vagina is bleeding severely, put sterile gauze or clean cloths on the area, unless a foreign body is suspected. Apply cold compresses to help reduce swelling. If the testicles have been injured, support them with a sling made from towels.",
+          "qualifier_or_exception": "All conditions and exceptions in this excerpt were checked against the complete card.",
+          "card_carries": true,
+          "verdict": "PASS"
+        },
+        {
+          "field_path": "do[3]",
+          "text": "لو الخصيتين اتصابوا، اسندهم بحمّالة معمولة من فوط، وحطهم على قماشة مبطّنة زي الحفاضة.",
+          "source_id": "mlp:genital-injury",
+          "source_context_section": "First Aid",
+          "source_excerpt": "Place a clean cloth or sterile dressing on any open wounds. If the vagina is bleeding severely, put sterile gauze or clean cloths on the area, unless a foreign body is suspected. Apply cold compresses to help reduce swelling. If the testicles have been injured, support them with a sling made from towels. Place them on a padded cloth, such as a diaper. If there is an object stuck in a body opening or wound, leave it alone and seek medical attention.",
+          "qualifier_or_exception": "All conditions and exceptions in this excerpt were checked against the complete card.",
+          "card_carries": true,
+          "verdict": "PASS"
+        },
+        {
+          "field_path": "do[4]",
+          "text": "لو فيه جسم عالق في فتحة في الجسم أو في جرح، سيبه مكانه واطلب مساعدة طبية؛ إخراجه ممكن يسبّب ضرر أكتر.",
+          "source_id": "mlp:genital-injury",
+          "source_context_section": "First Aid",
+          "source_excerpt": "If the vagina is bleeding severely, put sterile gauze or clean cloths on the area, unless a foreign body is suspected. Apply cold compresses to help reduce swelling. If the testicles have been injured, support them with a sling made from towels. Place them on a padded cloth, such as a diaper. If there is an object stuck in a body opening or wound, leave it alone and seek medical attention. Taking it out may cause more damage. DO NOT DO NOT try to remove an object by yourself.",
+          "qualifier_or_exception": "All conditions and exceptions in this excerpt were checked against the complete card.",
+          "card_carries": true,
+          "verdict": "PASS"
+        },
+        {
+          "field_path": "dont[0]",
+          "text": "ماتحاولش تشيل جسم عالق بنفسك؛ اطلب مساعدة طبية فورًا.",
+          "source_id": "mlp:genital-injury",
+          "source_context_section": "DO NOT / safety context",
+          "source_excerpt": "Place them on a padded cloth, such as a diaper. If there is an object stuck in a body opening or wound, leave it alone and seek medical attention. Taking it out may cause more damage. DO NOT DO NOT try to remove an object by yourself. Seek medical help right away. Never volunteer your thoughts on how you think the injury happened.",
+          "qualifier_or_exception": "All conditions and exceptions in this excerpt were checked against the complete card.",
+          "card_carries": true,
+          "verdict": "PASS"
+        },
+        {
+          "field_path": "dont[1]",
+          "text": "ماتقولش توقّعاتك عن الإصابة حصلت إزاي. لو شاكك إنها نتيجة اعتداء أو إساءة، ماتخليش المصاب يغيّر هدومه أو ياخد حمّام، واطلب مساعدة طبية فورًا.",
+          "source_id": "mlp:genital-injury",
+          "source_context_section": "DO NOT / safety context",
+          "source_excerpt": "If there is an object stuck in a body opening or wound, leave it alone and seek medical attention. Taking it out may cause more damage. DO NOT DO NOT try to remove an object by yourself. Seek medical help right away. Never volunteer your thoughts on how you think the injury happened. If you think the injury was the result of assault or abuse, DO NOT let the person change clothes or take a bath or shower. Seek medical help right away. When to Contact a Medical Professional A straddle injury is damage to the testicle or urinary tract.",
+          "qualifier_or_exception": "All conditions and exceptions in this excerpt were checked against the complete card.",
+          "card_carries": true,
+          "verdict": "PASS"
