+          "source_excerpt": "Taking it out may cause more damage. DO NOT DO NOT try to remove an object by yourself. Seek medical help right away. Never volunteer your thoughts on how you think the injury happened. If you think the injury was the result of assault or abuse, DO NOT let the person change clothes or take a bath or shower.",
