+          "source_excerpt": "Head injuries may be associated with spinal injuries. Do not remove protruding objects. Do not allow the person to continue with physical activities. Do not forget to watch the person closely until medical help arrives. Do not give the person any medicines before talking to a health care provider. Do not leave the person alone, even if there are no obvious problems.",
